The prompt-learning method follows CoOp (Zhou et al., "Learning to Prompt for
Vision-Language Models", IJCV 2022).

Data
----
The eight datasets used (Oxford-IIIT Pets, Describable Textures Dataset,
EuroSAT, Oxford Flowers-102, Food-101, Caltech-101, UCF-101 and FGVC-Aircraft)
are not redistributed in this repository. Each is obtained from its original
provider and is subject to that provider's terms. Learned prompt vectors
released by this project are derived from these datasets.
